{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_27_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_27","textTraditional":"一、十有六年，春正月，公會宋公、蔡侯、衞侯于曹。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_27_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_27","textTraditional":"二、夏四月，公會宋公、衞侯、陳侯、蔡侯伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_27_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_27","textTraditional":"三、秋七月，公至自伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_27_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_27","textTraditional":"四、冬，城向。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_27_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_27","textTraditional":"五、十有一月，衞侯朔出奔齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_27_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_27","textTraditional":"衞侯朔何以名？絕。曷為絕之？得罪于天子也。其得罪于天子，奈何？見使守衞朔，而不能使衞小眾，越在岱陰齊。屬負茲，舍不即罪爾。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}